IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TREE-SPECULATIVE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-BRANCHES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACCEPTED-BRANCHES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 VERIFIED-TOKENS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-TREE-SPEC.
    IF NUM-BRANCHES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE VERIFIED-TOKENS = ACCEPTED-BRANCHES * 2.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 VERIFIED-TOKENS.
    WEIGHT 30 ACCEPTED-BRANCHES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
